msgstr ""
"** Parameters **\n"
"\n"
"*   *   **Definition**: A parameter is a variable that is used to modify the behavior of a function or method.\n"
"*   *   **Types**: The type of data that can be passed as an argument to a function or method.\n"
"*   *   **Default values**: Values assigned to parameters when they are not provided during function calls.\n"
